Main concerns from reviewers include:
1. Requires internal activations/gradients (open-weight only);
2. Fairness definition may be task-dependent;
3. Cue selection/word ambiguity need validation;
4. Bias evaluation needs broader, pitfall-aware benchmarks;
5. Templates/limited cue types.
